WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.630
At a café in Paris,

2
00:00:01.630 --> 00:00:05.630
your friend sighs, «J'ai
faim.» Word for word:

3
00:00:05.630 --> 00:00:07.210
I have hunger.

4
00:00:07.210 --> 00:00:08.390
You ask how old she is.

5
00:00:08.390 --> 00:00:11.420
«J'ai quinze ans.» Word for word again:

6
00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:13.340
I have fifteen years.

7
00:00:13.340 --> 00:00:14.880
No 'am' anywhere.

8
00:00:14.880 --> 00:00:16.410
Just the verb for 'have',

9
00:00:16.410 --> 00:00:17.990
again and again.

10
00:00:17.990 --> 00:00:23.020
So why does French say 'I have
hunger' and 'I have fifteen years'?

11
00:00:23.020 --> 00:00:26.340
In this mission, you'll fill
a grid of four key verbs:

12
00:00:26.340 --> 00:00:30.060
«être», «avoir», «aller» and «faire».

13
00:00:30.060 --> 00:00:32.700
Then you'll build sentences chip by chip,

14
00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.860
choosing between «sommes» and «avons».

15
00:00:35.860 --> 00:00:39.480
Your mission: find out why
French says «J'ai faim»

16
00:00:39.480 --> 00:00:40.990
and «J'ai quinze ans».
